    <div class="rc-desc">Multi-hop tunneling through segmented AD networks. Agent chaining, route injection, and traffic routing without proxychains.</div>
    <span class="rc-arrow">→</span>
  </a>
  <a href="/research/adcs-esc" class="research-card" data-cat="ad">
    <div class="rc-tag ad">Active Directory</div>
    <div class="rc-title">AD CS ESC1–ESC8 Attack Chains</div>
    <div class="rc-desc">Complete Certipy-driven exploitation of all 8 ADCS misconfigurations — from enrollment abuse to CA key theft.</div>
