  <a href="/research/sysreptor" class="research-card" data-cat="tools">
    <div class="rc-tag tools">Tools & Setup</div>
    <div class="rc-title">SysReptor Complete Setup</div>
    <div class="rc-desc">Docker install, CPTS finding templates, CVSS calculator integration, screenshot embedding, and PDF export pipeline.</div>
    <span class="rc-arrow">→</span>
  </a>
