    <div class="rc-title">HTB Machines → CPTS Modules</div>
    <div class="rc-desc">Curated list of 30+ HTB machines mapped to specific CPTS exam objectives. Ordered by difficulty and topic coverage.</div>
    <span class="rc-arrow">→</span>
